<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Benco says offer price in circular wrong.</title>
<headline>Benco says offer price in circular wrong.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining exploration firm Benguela Concessions Ltd (Benco) said on Friday that an offer price referred to in a circular concerning, among other things, an odd-lot offer to shareholders, was incorrect.</p>
<p>It said shareholders could complete a form of election annexed to the circular, provided a correct offer price of 355 cents a share was used.</p>
<p>Alternatively, shareholders could use an amended form of election which reflected the correct price which had been sent to shareholders.</p>
